# NOTE: deploy/fpk/ SOURCE (manifest, cmd/, wizard/, docker/docker-compose.yaml,
# docker/hanbao.env, app/NOTICE, app/CHANGES-FROM-UPSTREAM.md, app/ui/) stays tracked.
# Only the generated image tar + the built .fpk package are ignored.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
console/dist/
deliverables/
deploy/fpk/app/docker/*.tar
deploy/tools/
*.fpk